coursebody+='</div><details class="audit-details"><summary>If you choose PL-300: the separate exam boundary <span>Optional</span></summary><div class="evidence-body"><p>Microsoft’s skills guide effective 20 April 2026 covers Prepare data (25–30%), Model data (25–30%), Visualize/analyze (25–30%), and Manage/secure (15–20%). The general roadmap is <b>not a complete current exam-prep course</b>.</p><p>Before booking, check every current objective, including the newer Import/DirectQuery/DirectLake distinctions, calculation groups, visual calculations, Copilot features, workspace governance and sensitivity/access controls. Some features require suitable accounts or capacity. Do not buy platform capacity just to keep up with an optional study plan.</p>'+A('https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/credentials/certifications/resources/study-guides/pl-300','Current official PL-300 skills guide')+'</div></details>'
